health.{Aruchah;} not a plaister, as some, or progress, as others;
but health, or the healing or closing of a wound, as the
cognate Arabic {areekat} signifies, from {araka,} to heal.

thou shalt bind.This was the emblem of its overthrow and irretrievable ruin;
and the same emblem is employed in Re 18:21, to denote the
utter ruin of mystical Babylon.
